            <ArticleTitle>Practical classification for the use of nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>263-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The podiatric physician is faced with a multitude of nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs from which to choose. Podiatric physicians are overwhelmed with advertisements in the literature, outlining the safety and efficacy of one or another of these medications. This article will categorize the nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs to aid in their selection.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
